        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo LP-2878, Outswinging Entry Door Slimline Latch Guard</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSleek slimline design door latch protector designed specifically for outswing doors (door opens out of the room or building). For use with key-in knobs / levers (door knobs or levers that use a key to unlock). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe mounting studs are concealed welded to the back side of the security plate leaving no visible point of attack from the outside. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-LP-2878_size.gif?v=1704354540\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo LP-2878 Security Latch Guard size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNon-Handed, reversible for left or right hand outswinging doors.  Extra heavy duty construction made from steel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Don-Jo LP-2878 Security Latch Guard\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 8-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed (reversible)</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: 2 each 1/4-20 x 1-3/4\" flat head machine screws and finishing washers.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LP-2878.pdf?v=1704262301\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo LP-2878 Security Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
