                "description": "Don-Jo LP-2878 Entry Door Slimline Latch Guard.  Sleek slimline design door latch protector designed specifically for outswing doors (door opens out of the room or building). For use with key-in knobs / levers (door knobs or levers that use a key to unlock).  The mounting studs are concealed welded to the back side of the security plate leaving no visible point of attack from the outside. Packaged with mounting hardware.",
